WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:06.601
indexOf is case-sensitive: it doesn't find Wereld with a capital, so minus one.

2
00:06.601 --> 00:13.778
replace only replaces the first match it finds. With [[/la/g|slash la slash g]] you replace them all.

3
00:13.778 --> 00:18.506
repeat repeats a string, and toLowerCase turns everything into lowercase.
